lass=\"err\">with</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"new\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$new</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"f\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$f</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"r.drop\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$r.drop</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"t.new\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t.new</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"tbl\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">table</span> <span class=\"nv\">$d</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"tbl\"</span><span class=\"p\">))))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">result</span> <span class=\"err\">u</span><span class=\"mi\">32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">canon</span> <span class=\"err\">l</span><span class=\"nb\">if</span><span class=\"err\">t</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$o</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_trap</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">invoke</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"cannot remove owned resource while borrowed\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>fails with:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">W</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">stack</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">switching</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Error</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">to</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">script</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">file</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">'</span><span class=\"na\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"o\">'</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Caused</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">by</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">directive</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">on</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">77</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">expected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trap</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">got</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Component</span><span class=\"p\">([</span><span class=\"n\">U32</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1000022</span><span class=\"p\">)])</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>Without the <code>resume</code> in <code>$resume-then-drop</code>, the drop traps with \"cannot remove owned resource while borrowed\" as expected.<br>\n</p>\n</blockquote>",
